      "message": "Increasing the poll interval from 2s to 10s also increases the worst-case readiness wait from 30s to 150s with the current retry count (maxRetries \u003d 15). Is that total timeout increases intentional across all platforms, or should retry count be adjusted to keep a similar overall timeout?",
